iles\n- Fix queries for some home screen sections returning wrong items\n- Add new spotlight home screen section option\n- Add new home screen section type called dynamic media with sorting and filtering functions\n- Update to sqlite 3.51.2\n- Fix regression with hiding users from login screens on remote connections\n- Add sorting options to new home screen editor\n- Add Copy Data to Users context menu command\n- Fixes with home screen sections migration\n- Revamp home screen section options with new section editor\n- Add banner text option to server settings\n- Support person credits at the bottom of person detail screens\n- Playback fixes for Chromecast\n- Fix subtitle encoding regression with LG TV's\n- Fix Hardware Transcoding for HDR Video when Tone Mapping is enabled\n\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/307889015/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/307128745","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/307128745/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/307128745/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/tag/4.10.0.9","id":307128745,"author":{"login":"emby-code","id":260705169,"node_id":"U_kgDOD4oLkQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260705169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emby-code","html_url":"https://github.com/emby-code","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emby-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emby-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emby-code/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emby-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emby-code/subscriptions